{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19544","headline":"缑山鹤 · 张仲素","name":"缑山鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽客骖仙鹤，将飞驻碧山。\n映松残雪在，度岭片云还。\n清唳因风远，高姿对水闲。\n笙歌忆天上，城郭叹人间。\n几变霜毛洁，方殊藻质斑。\n迢迢烟路逸，奋翮讵能攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张仲素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}